<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>
<p>
Dear {{ user.username }},<br>
Welcome to CGHMN!<br>
Here are your connection details:
</p>
<table>
    <tr>
        <td>Tunnel IP:</td>
        <td>{{ peer.tunnelIP }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Wireguard Preshared Key:</td>
        <td>{{ peer.presharedKey }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>Routed Subnet:</td>
        <td>{{ peer.allowedIPs[0].cidr }}</td>
    </tr>
</table>
<p>
Here's an example config you can use:
</p>
<pre>{{ exampleConfig }}</pre>
<p>
If you're not sure how to set up your CGHMN router,<br>
you can find some beginner-friendly instructions at<br>
<a href="https://wiki.cursedsilicon.net/wiki/Signup">https://wiki.cursedsilicon.net/wiki/Signup</a><br>
You can also use our OpenWrt image builder at
<a href="https://firmware.cghmn.org/?user_data={{ peer.firmwareConfig }}">https://firmware.cghmn.org/</a><br>
If you need help with anything,<br>
feel free to reach out at <a href="mailto:{{ contactEmail }}">{{ contactEmail }}</a><br>
Once you're connected, you should first visit http://landingpage.retro/<br>
where you can find a plethora of services, tutorials, and other information<br>
perfect for newcomers.<br>
Have fun!<br>
-The CGHMN Team
</p>
</body>
</html>
